OL,6,
OL,7,FJurors in the trial of Lindsay Clancy,
OL,8,Faccused of murdering her three
OL,9,Fchildren, remain deadlocked
OL,11,FThe judge has ordered them to keep
OL,12,Fdeliberating
OL,14,FClancy is on trial for killing her
OL,15,Fthree small children in the basement of
OL,16,Ftheir family home in Massachusetts in
OL,17,F2023
OL,19,FShe is charged with three counts of
OL,20,Ffirst-degree murder, as the prosecution
OL,21,Fargues Clancy made a calculated,
OL,22,Fintentional decision to kill them
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
